  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/06/IMG_4970.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=38455\" target=\"_blank\">barrio Sant Pere de Onda </a>ha celebrado este s&aacute;bado la fiesta de su patr&oacute;n, con procesi&oacute;n y&nbsp;misa en la iglesia de la Asunci&oacute;n. Por la noche, en la calle de La Luz, Juan Ram&oacute;n Cort&eacute;s y los suyos han ofrecido un concierto muy concurrido.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimerfestesbarrisantpere/img_4917.jpg\" alt=\"img_4917\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimerfestesbarrisantpere/img_4918.jpg\" alt=\"img_4918\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimerfestesbarrisantpere/img_4919.jpg\" alt=\"img_4919\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimerfestesbarrisantpere/img_4920.jpg\" alt=\"img_4920\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimerfestesbarrisantpere/img_4921.jpg\" alt=\"img_4921\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimerfestesbarrisantpere/img_4922.jpg\" alt=\"img_4922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimerfestesbarrisantpere/img_4923.jpg\" alt=\"img_4923\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengeprimerfestesbarrisantpere/img_4924.jpg\" alt=\"img_4924\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25d